  "extracted_from": "raw/gamedata/newEvents.xml",
  "text": {
    "value": "As soon as you jump into the system, you receive a hail from a nearby civilian Engi vessel. Their Captain appears on your screen: \"Strange bug. Can you assist in debugging?\"",
