    "options": [
      {
        "label": "Listen to their problem.",
        "gate": null,
        "child": {
          "text": {
            "value": "\"Found malfunctioning Mantis. Believes it is human. Will receive input only from human. Danger Evaluation: Extremely High. Provide assistance.\"",
            "ref": "event_CONFUSED_MANTIS_c1_text"
          },
          "effects": [],
          "node": {
            "kind": "decision",
            "options": [
              {
                "label": "Send a shuttle with an away team to help.",
                "gate": null,
                "child": {
                  "effects": [],
                  "node": {
                    "kind": "chance",
                    "list": "CONFUSED_MANTIS_DEFAULT",
                    "source": "raw/gamedata/newEvents.xml",
                    "odds_basis": "unweighted",
                    "options": [
                      {
                        "share": null,
                        "child": {
                          "text": {
                            "value": "After an hour of convincing, the Mantis finally calms down and introduces himself as Robert Smith. He explains he's from a nearby human colony and would appreciate being returned there.",
                            "ref": "event_CONFUSED_MANTIS_DEFAULT_1_text"
                          },
                          "effects": [],
                          "node": {
                            "kind": "decision",
                            "options": [
                              {
                                "label": "Continue...",
                                "gate": null,
                                "child": {
                                  "text": {
                                    "value": "The colony is a mining operation that specializes in FTL fuel. Robert's family, the head engineers, are excited to see him, and are very grateful for his return. Apparently he ran away to 'join the Federation' like his older brother, but was never accepted onto a ship.",
                                    "ref": "event_CONFUSED_MANTIS_HOME_text"
                                  },
                                  "name": "CONFUSED_MANTIS_HOME",
                                  "source": "raw/gamedata/newEvents.xml",
                                  "effects": [],
                                  "node": {
                                    "kind": "decision",
                                    "options": [
                                      {
                                        "label": "Offer him a position on your ship.",
                                        "gate": null,
                                        "child": {
                                          "text": {
                                            "value": "He graciously accepts, having always wanted to serve in the Federation.",
                                            "ref": "event_CONFUSED_MANTIS_HOME_c1_text"
                                          },
                                          "effects": [
                                            {
                                              "kind": "crew_gain",
                                              "amount": 1,
                                              "class": "mantis",
                                              "name": "RobertSmith"
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "label_ref": "event_CONFUSED_MANTIS_HOME_c1_choice",
                                        "hidden": true
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "label": "Ask if they can take a look at your engines.",
                                        "gate": null,
                                        "child": {
                                          "text": {
                                            "value": "They are happy to take a look, and are able to offer some suggestions for improvements.",
                                            "ref": "event_CONFUSED_MANTIS_HOME_c2_text"
                                          },
                                          "effects": [
                                            {
                                              "kind": "upgrade",
                                              "system": "engines",
                                              "amount": 1
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "label_ref": "event_CONFUSED_MANTIS_HOME_c2_choice",
                                        "hidden": true
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                "label_ref": "continue"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "share": null,
                        "child": {
                          "text": {
                            "value": "The cornered and frightened Mantis attacks as soon as you approach. One of your crew is eviscerated before the rest are able to stop him. The Engi apologize for your loss.",
