                  "lvl": "1"
                },
                "child": {
                  "text": {
                    "value": "The Mantis calms down and communicates thanks to the Engi and yourself for helping. He requests to be dropped off at a nearby planet, at the human colony where he was raised. They are grateful for his return and offer a reward.",
